---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Play"
  description="Fun interactive tools and games. Test your SEO intuition, generate halftone art, and quiz your Google algorithm knowledge."
  currentSlug="play"
>
  <p class="echo" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cwd">~/play</span><span class="chev"></span><span class="cmd">ls</span></p>
  <h1 class="page-title">play</h1>
  <p class="lede">fun stuff I've built. more coming.</p>
  <ul class="runs">
    <li><a href="/play/surge/"><span class="run-cmd">./surge</span><span class="run-title">SERP Surge</span><span class="run-desc">dodge algorithm updates, collect ranking boosts, survive. wave survival with shields and combos.</span><span class="run-keys">mouse to move, <kbd>space</kbd> shield, <kbd>P</kbd> pause, <kbd>M</kbd> music</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/play/serpent/"><span class="run-cmd">./serpent</span><span class="run-title">SERPent</span><span class="run-desc">classic snake with unlockable themes and achievements. eat, grow, rank.</span><span class="run-keys"><kbd>arrow keys</kbd> or <kbd>WASD</kbd>, <kbd>space</kbd>, <kbd>P</kbd> pause, <kbd>M</kbd> music</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/play/keywords/"><span class="run-cmd">./keywords</span><span class="run-title">seo intuition test</span><span class="run-desc">guess which keyword has higher search volume. 10 rounds, trust your gut.</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/play/updates/"><span class="run-cmd">./updates</span><span class="run-title">name that google update</span><span class="run-desc">guess the algorithm update from its description. test your seo history.</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/play/halftone/"><span class="run-cmd">./halftone</span><span class="run-title">halftone generator</span><span class="run-desc">convert any image to halftone dots or ASCII art. download or animate.</span><span class="run-go" aria-hidden="true">run</span></a></li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
